    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d426">

                <pb facs="0633" n="611" xml:id="pg611"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">350/8–1351</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum Prepared in the Office of Dependent Area
                        Affairs</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1951-08-19">August 19, 1951</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Suggested Topics for Informal Consultations on
                        Dependent Area Questions Arising in the United Nations</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">a. general questions</hi>
                </p>
                <p>1. Basic views of the United States and ______ with respect to questions
                    involving non-self-governing peoples and the treatment of such questions in the
                    United Nations.</p>
                <p>2. Relationship of the General Assembly (Committee Four) to the Trusteeship
                    Council and to the Special Committee on Information Transmitted under Article
                        73(<hi rendition="#italic">e</hi>) of the Charter.</p>
                <p>3. The functioning of the Trusteeship Council.</p>
                <p>4. The functioning of the Special Committee on Information Transmitted under
                    Article 73(<hi rendition="#italic">e</hi>) of the Charter.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">b. specific questions</hi>
                </p>
                <p>1. South West Africa</p>
                <p>2. Italian participation in the Trusteeship Council</p>
                <p>3. General Assembly consideration of Trusteeship Council procedures</p>
                <p>4. The transmission of political information under Article 73(<hi
                        rendition="#italic">e</hi>)</p>
                <p>5. The question of “the factors which should be taken into account in deciding
                    whether a territory is or is not a territory whose peoples have not yet achieved
                    a full measure of self-government”</p>
                <p>6. The Ewe problem<anchor n="1" xml:id="d426-f1"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
